["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lovart 創始人陳冕×羅永浩！且讓我大鬧一場，然後悄然離去 AI native reward model AGI Agent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-09-cn2d7912-ai十年内不会让人类没用-这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21e3cf477d7561e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>AI十年內不會讓人類沒用：這是陳冕押上全部身家的賭注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI十年內學不會人類的品味和判斷，像Lovart這樣需要人介入的設計產品就還有價值；一旦判斷錯，公司也會跟著完蛋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">產品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市訪談，和智譜CEO張鵬聊：敢問路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，張鵬說中國 AI 沒有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國資本市場可能有泡沫，中國不存在——中國投 AI 的錢只有美國的二十幾分之一，遠遠不夠。張鵬的邏輯是：離 AGI 還遠、錢還不夠，就更得投，不投它不會自然發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"128. Manus決定出售前最後的訪談：啊，這奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4744d9a1060b8431-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 決定出售前最後訪談：AI 沒有蠻荒期，因為沒新平臺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移動互聯網的蠻荒期來自硬件換代，桌面到手機讓巨頭和個人開發者眾生平等；AI 技術突破更大，卻沒有出現全新平臺，所以巨頭、創業公司、個人開發者反應一樣快，蠻荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影石Insta360 創始人劉靖康×羅永浩！比生存更重要的是那些微小的念頭 337 Investigation NPE PMF DFM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-25-cn2d7912-硬刚大疆做无人机-他们图的不是打败对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/096fe60475239ebc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1225</span></div>\n<h2>硬剛大疆做無人機，他們圖的不是打敗對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消費級無人機此前幾乎全軍覆沒，他們明知如此仍進場，理由不是搶市場，而是做無人機能一次性把公司的技術、製造、供應鏈能力拉到新臺階，幫企業穿越下一個週期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件創業</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季報跨年對談：和廣密預言一場AI War、兩大聯盟和第三個範式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨頭砸光最後一分錢也不下牌桌的戰爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 AI 泡沫，是拿商業回報算出來的賬；巨頭把它當成新的國防或核武器，算的是被顛覆的風險——所以寧可砸光最後一分錢，也不輕易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"126. 和紅杉鄭慶生聊：經濟史的流量革命、人類行為模式的不可預期，與創始人性格 雙邊網絡效應 PMF 倖存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的網絡沒有自然壟斷，邊際成本不趨近於零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網產品是巨大的城鎮，邊際成本趨近於零所以贏家通吃；AI 每多一個用戶就多一份 token 成本，這個差別會改寫流量節點的商業設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"導演大鵬×羅永浩！我這兩輩子\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-17-cn2d7912-大鹏-我好像活了两辈子-上辈子总被保安轰-被粉丝踩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/225eff6d82f85e3d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">5:02:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1217</span></div>\n<h2>大鵬：我好像活了兩輩子，上輩子總被保安轟、被粉絲踩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鵬說自己好像活了兩輩子：上一輩子他穿短褲在電影節紅毯盡頭被保安呵斥、在直播現場被粉絲踩在腳底下；這一輩子他走紅毯、領獎，迎面喊他名字的還是當年那群記者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物訪談</span><span class=\"tag\">創業者成長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投資札記第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美國資本壞小孩、算盤與泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商業模式是負向滾雪球，越燒越虧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的訓練成本乘以十去燒下一代模型，收入卻只按上一年的兩倍回收，加 2 減 10，現金流年年更負。只有停止燒錢那天，利潤表才會突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"124. 雨森的創投觀察第1集：2026年預期、The Year of R、回調、我們如何下注 Year of R New Labs proactive agent Remote Labor Index OOD\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-13-zhangxiaojun-2026-是回报之年-模型没有秘密-应用才有护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9da6aa992d11d172-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:23:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1213</span></div>\n<h2>2026 是回報之年：模型沒有秘密，應用才有護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能力進步在放緩，中國開源模型把差距壓到 6-12 個月，API 生意沒有壟斷性壁壘；真正值錢的是模型之外那層 context、工具和環境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">模型護城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"123. 對ONE2X創始人王冠3小時訪談：生成系統、沒有中間商賺差價、內容平臺的權力分配 DSL System 1 / System 2 Context Engineering prosumer reward function\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-12-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司-中间商会被干掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/892c212740d3e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1212</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的公司最終都是生成系統公司，中間商會被幹掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網平臺靠分配權剝削生產端，同樣的內容不同人發量不一樣，說明分配機制失效。生成系統把分配內化，直接連接需求和生產，產銷合一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生成系統</span><span class=\"tag\">數據飛輪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"MiniMax 創始人閆俊傑×羅永浩！大山並非無法翻越 Scaling Law AGI Exploration/Exploitation MOE OpenRouter\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-10-cn2d7912-缩放定律最早在百度被发现-但做出gpt的却是美国公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ffd4880abb9af1d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1210</span></div>\n<h2>縮放定律最早在百度被發現，但做出GPT的卻是美國公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MiniMax創始人嚴俊傑說，奠定大模型根基的縮放定律2014年就已經在百度被發現，但真正做出GPT的卻是沒有歷史包袱的美國創業公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">成本結構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"122. 朱嘯虎現實主義故事的第三次連載：人工智能的盛筵與泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年內看不到泡沫，但 VC 共識太集中才是真風險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎說泡沫論是二級市場投資人在故意引導回調，真正的問題是一級市場每個項目都成了 Club Deal，GP 賺不了大錢、LP 也不開心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"121. 對DeepMind譚捷的訪談：機器人、跨本體、世界模型、Gemini Robotics 1.5和Google VLA cross embodiment transfer motion transfer sim to real egocentric video embodiment gap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-28-zhangxiaojun-机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法-是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/946401201b99ef46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>機器人最大的瓶頸不是算法，是數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">譚捷在 Google DeepMind 做了十年機器人，他的判斷是：機器人基座模型至今還不是獨立學科，只是多模態大模型的微調；真正的瓶頸是數據，而搖操採數據不是終局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"導演畢贛×羅永浩！清醒、深刻、獨一無二的造夢者\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-28-cn2d7912-路边野餐开场沉闷不是失误-而是让观众像爬山一样抵达日出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e517097b0b03288b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:20:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>路邊野餐開場沉悶不是失誤，而是讓觀眾像爬山一樣抵達日出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">畢贛說真正尊重觀眾，是尊重觀眾的潛意識而非喜好：前半段的障礙不會被剪掉，因為翻過障礙抵達的震撼，和直接到達完全是兩回事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長鏡頭</span><span class=\"tag\">文藝片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何同學×羅永浩！青年何同學的驕傲與煩惱 MVP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-20-cn2d7912-何同学海外视频播放破千万-半年youtube收入仅2万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0106480d1afb6af1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:30:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>何同學海外視頻播放破千萬，半年YouTube收入僅2萬美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">外界曾傳聞英文頻道靠YouTube分成年入百萬到千萬，何同學親口澄清：做了半年總收入只有兩萬美元，長視頻一期也就兩三千美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自媒體創業</span><span class=\"tag\">內容選題</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"120. 小鵬新上任的劉先明首次訪談：Language是毒藥、拆掉L、簡單即美、換帥、小鵬的AI轉型 VLA Latent COT scaling Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-18-zhangxiaojun-小鹏拆掉语言模型-language-是毒药-简单即美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e2c3717dde66c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>小鵬拆掉語言模型：Language 是毒藥，簡單即美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬自動駕駛新負責人劉先明把 VLA 裡的 Language 拆掉，用 27 萬到 30 萬小時純視覺數據直接輸出控制信號，因為 Language 是離散的、低效的，會成為數據規模化的瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"魔術大師劉謙×羅永浩！你所不知道的劉謙 misdirection Force Crossing Card Force 巴格拉斯效應\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-11-cn2d7912-魔术师手速快不是真相-靠的是转移你的注意力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e93f477040d6a053-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:28:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>魔術師手速快不是真相，靠的是轉移你的注意力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劉謙說「手速快」是魔術師自古編造出來掩蓋真相的說法，真正的核心技術是misdirection，把觀眾的注意力和思維同時引開。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">魔術</span><span class=\"tag\">misdirection</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和楊松琳考古算法變種史，並預演未來架構改進方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>純線性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共識</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">純 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限無保證；Kimi、千問都收斂到每 3 層線性插 1 層全局注意力，而 MiniMax 從 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因為評測漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"118. 對李想的第二次3小時訪談：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文鋒、VLA、能量、記憶、對抗人性、親密關係、人類的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a2c96d240eb08aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年內不會出現，只會先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判斷通用 agent 五年內不會出現，真正會出現的是 agentOS——各專業在上面開發自己的專業 agent。因為生產工具必須能行動、能替代專業工作，而不是給個建議。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"賈樟柯×羅永浩！成為賈樟柯（上）\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-29-cn2d7912-一次被放鸽子的下午-一场电影决定了贾樟柯要去拍电影/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9972a3ea5b348a4e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:45:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>一次被放鴿子的下午，一場電影決定了賈樟柯要去拍電影</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一次赴約被放鴿子後，賈樟柯在電影院偶然看到《黃土地》,發現自己最熟悉卻視而不見的家鄉生活原來可以被電影這樣講述，當場決定要去拍電影。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">賈樟柯</span><span class=\"tag\">導演成長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"117. 開源一段論文探索之旅：模型範式、Infra和數據、語言、多模態的完整變遷史 MFU MOE COT LoRA RLHF 光流\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-28-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a079c1aa86947eb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">4:22:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>模型是煉油廠：第一階段的贏家不是最後的贏家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商業史上第一波跑出來的公司幾乎從不是下個階段的贏家。模型公司是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">論文精讀</span><span class=\"tag\">模型範式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"名創優品葉國富×羅永浩！重塑線下購物，讓人們重新愛上逛街！ SKU fine dining\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-22-cn2d7912-名创优品老板-超市只分两种-卖产品的活-卖货架的死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c387de8b2a7bb5e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:54:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>名創優品老闆：超市只分兩種，賣產品的活，賣貨架的死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">葉國富說，山姆和胖東來靠做好產品活下來，其他超市靠進場費、上架費賺錢，這套邏輯正是他收購永輝、複製胖東來模式的全部依據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線下零售</span><span class=\"tag\">IP運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"宋方金×羅永浩！故事必須有人講下去 science fiction\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-17-cn2d7912-编剧不该怕机器人像人-该怕人越来越像机器人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d1f8cd96251a093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">5:22:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>編劇不該怕機器人像人，該怕人越來越像機器人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宋方金說現在的AI寫故事大綱已經超過六成編劇，真正的危機不是技術取代創作，而是創作者早已把自己寫成套路機器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">影視行業</span><span class=\"tag\">編劇生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影視颶風TIM×羅永浩！用影像打開世界的夢想家 OKR ENTP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-10-cn2d7912-做内容赚不到规模化的钱-靠卖t恤一年卖出上百万件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8526f00042d68a45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:51:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>做內容賺不到規模化的錢，靠賣T恤一年賣出上百萬件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">影視颶風內容本身沒有規模效應，一期視頻賺一期的錢；真正能複製、能賣出幾十萬到上百萬件的是T恤和衝鋒衣，這才是支撐公司的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自媒體變現</span><span class=\"tag\">內容規模化</span>\n</div></div></a>"]